 "ui.monthlyAmount": "Monthly amount",
 "ui.theMonthlyBillIsTheActualLoanOr": "The monthly bill is the actual loan or lease payment plus separately paid insurance during repayment. After a loan ends, only insurance remains in this recurring bill; maintenance and tyres remain separate. The outright option has only insurance in its monthly bill. Purchase price, VAT refunds, deposits, balloon payments and buyouts are separate. The effective monthly cost spreads the full ownership cost over the term and follows both toggles above. Invoice rows remain the actual nominal quote amounts.",
