 "ui.requiredNominalAnnualLoanRateWithVatTreatment": "Required nominal annual loan rate, with VAT treatment and the opportunity-cost choice above. Only the loan’s interest rate changes. Other quotes and manual tax-deduction budgets stay fixed. Matches follow this section’s annual or full-term basis.",
