 "ui.averageCostPerYear": "Average cost per year",
 "ui.beforeAnnualAveragingThePurchasePriceStaysAt": "Before annual averaging, the purchase price stays at today’s invoice value. With today’s money on, the benefit of paying loan principal later appears as a separate credit. Future buyouts and other costs use their payment or receipt dates. The inflation-effect row only summarises effects already included; only opportunity cost is added to the subtotal.",
 "ui.beforeAnnualAveragingThePurchasePriceStaysAt_past": "Before annual averaging, the purchase price stays at today’s invoice value. With purchase-date money on, the benefit of paying loan principal later appears as a separate credit. Future buyouts and other costs use their payment or receipt dates. The inflation-effect row only summarises effects already included; only opportunity cost is added to the subtotal.",
 "ui.opportunityCostBreakdown": "Opportunity cost breakdown",
 "ui.foregoneReturnByCashFlow": "Foregone return by cash flow",
 "ui.positiveAmountsAddCostNegativeAmountsShowThe": "Positive amounts add cost. Negative amounts show the return you can earn on refunded cash. Only groups with a nonzero contribution for a selected option are shown. These are timing costs, not the underlying payments. With today’s money off, end-of-term payments have no time left to accumulate a return. With it on, this table shows the difference between inflation-adjusted costs with and without opportunity cost, matching the cost breakdown.",
 "ui.positiveAmountsAddCostNegativeAmountsShowThe_past": "Positive amounts add cost. Negative amounts show the return you can earn on refunded cash. Only groups with a nonzero contribution for a selected option are shown. These are timing costs, not the underlying payments. With purchase-date money off, end-of-term payments have no time left to accumulate a return. With it on, this table shows the difference between inflation-adjusted costs with and without opportunity cost, matching the cost breakdown.",
